---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "Shake"
letter: "S"
anchor: "shake"
category: "edibles"
---

Small pieces of cannabis flower, trichome-coated leaves, and kief that accumulate at the bottom of a bag or container of flower. Shake is lower quality than intact buds for smoking but works perfectly well for edibles and infusions — often at a lower price per gram. Use more shake than you would whole flower to achieve equivalent potency.

→ [How to Make Cannabutter](/edibles/cannabis-infused-butter-cannabutter/)
